{"2719670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Milgram Experiment", "steam_appid": 2719670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Crafted without Gen A.I. No A.I. Art]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milgram Experiment is a single-player moral dilemma simulator where you are the judge, the jury, and the executioner. Investigate subjects by inspecting their personal items such as phones, diaries, voice recordings, chats in order to understand if they have a place in a new society that a mysterious figure is trying to build. The subjects you deem unworthy, you will have to... terminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE WISHLIST THE MILGRAM EXPERIMENT NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every test you will have to choоse between the lives of two subjects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail matters. Carefully examine the actions and lives of your subjects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their darkest secrets and solve complex moral dilemmas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminate the subject you deem unworthy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Content:</strong> Seven days of testing that will shape your destiny and lead to a unique ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storyline:</strong> Multiple secret endings will unfold trough your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Find ways to reach the dark corners of the facility and uncover the identity of <strong>the mysterious</strong> figure you are supposed to obey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> Realistic visuals inspired by games like <i>POOLS</i> and <i>UNRECORD</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> A sharp, cynical edge to the unfolding narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersion:</strong> The main character has no backstory, their <strong>choices</strong> are your choices, their <strong>beliefs</strong> are your beliefs, and their fate is your fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> This game is a work of fiction inspired by real psychological studies, including the historical Milgram experiment. This game is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Stanley Milgram, his estate, Yale University, or any official representation of the actual experiment. All characters, events, and scenarios in this game are fictional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Crafted without Gen A.I. No A.I. Art]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Milgram Experiment is a single-player moral dilemma simulator where you are the judge, the jury, and the executioner. Investigate subjects by inspecting their personal items such as phones, diaries, voice recordings, chats in order to understand if they have a place in a new society that a mysterious figure is trying to build. The subjects you deem unworthy, you will have to... terminate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE WISHLIST THE MILGRAM EXPERIMENT NOW!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In every test you will have to choоse between the lives of two subjects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/47b7e37956c1eec46455c9e719e81351.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail matters. Carefully examine the actions and lives of your subjects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/dae6300b647253f08880c54102c66f71.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover their darkest secrets and solve complex moral dilemmas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.poster.avif?t=1788189034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.webm?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/extras/c33d8c9aa9fa15e932bb2b721edbdd11.mp4?t=1788189034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terminate the subject you deem unworthy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Content:</strong> Seven days of testing that will shape your destiny and lead to a unique ending.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storyline:</strong> Multiple secret endings will unfold trough your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong> Find ways to reach the dark corners of the facility and uncover the identity of <strong>the mysterious</strong> figure you are supposed to obey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eerie Atmosphere:</strong> Realistic visuals inspired by games like <i>POOLS</i> and <i>UNRECORD</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Humor:</strong> A sharp, cynical edge to the unfolding narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersion:</strong> The main character has no backstory, their <strong>choices</strong> are your choices, their <strong>beliefs</strong> are your beliefs, and their fate is your fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Disclaimer:</i></strong><i> This game is a work of fiction inspired by real psychological studies, including the historical Milgram experiment. This game is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Stanley Milgram, his estate, Yale University, or any official representation of the actual experiment. All characters, events, and scenarios in this game are fictional.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A single-player moral dilemma simulator where you are judge, jury, and executioner. Investigate subjects through their personal items such as phones, diaries, and voice logs and uncover their darkest secrets. Judge if they fit a mysterious figure's new secret society. Terminate the unworthy.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Kinda reminds me of Portal, but instead of portals, you're killing people.”<br />\r\nNyanners's chat (1M followers), Demo 2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“I like this game. I'll definitely play the full version once it's out.”<br />\r\nGrimmi (110k followers), Demo 2026<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2719670/05ce2b8511fcf20c4212ce